OL,3,GLondon & Southeast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny spells are
OL,6,Fexpected for much of Sunday, though
OL,7,Fcloud may gradually increase during
OL,8,Fthe afternoon, with breezy conditions
OL,9,Fcontinuing throughout the day. Maximum
OL,10,FTemperature 11C.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSome clear spells to start
OL,13,Fthe night but becoming largely cloudy,
OL,14,Fwith a few outbreaks of light drizzle
OL,15,Fpossible. Breezy overnight, but winds
OL,16,Fstarting to ease towards dawn. Minimum
OL,17,FTemperature 7C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
