OL,3,GLondon & Southeast
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FRemaining cloudy on Monday but
OL,6,Flargely dry during the day, with a few
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain possible later.
OL,8,FBreezy at times but winds becoming
OL,9,Flight overnight. Maximum Temperature
OL,10,F12C.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FOutbreaks of rain for much of Tuesday,
OL,14,Fbut cloud clearing later with frost
OL,15,Fand fog overnight. Turning cloudy,
OL,16,Fwindy and unsettled on Wednesday with
OL,17,Foutbreaks of rain, continuing through
OL,18,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
